  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 504.03 Notification Flowchart.\n\n(a) Section 1 of the EAP shall be a chart identifying the individuals and local and state government agencies to be notified during a potential or actual emergency condition at the dam.\n\n(b) The notification flowchart shall be developed in coordination with local and state emergency responders and shall conform with the community’s current notification protocol of each.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 506.03); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 505.03)",
